Nudge Drive
Copyright 2026 The Nudge Drive contributors

Portions of the backend, Docker setup and setup scripts are derived from
earlier work Copyright 2026 Zenhosta, licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Those files have been modified. Major changes made by the
Nudge Drive contributors include:

- A largely rewritten web app (new design, home page, photo timeline, drives,
  free up space, notifications, activity, landing and legal pages, PWA).
- New native apps: an Android app and a Windows / macOS desktop app built
  with Kotlin and Compose Multiplatform (apps/).
- Free up space: moving files off a full Google Drive to other drives, and
  copying Google Photos out through the Google Photos Picker API.
- Automatic import of existing Google Drive files when a drive is connected,
  and a Drive sync that tracks missing files separately from the trash.
- Resumable (chunked) uploads, upload session tracking and an hourly recovery
  sweep for uploads that never finished.
- In-app document editing with Collabora Online over WOPI.
- Native Google sign-in for Android and loopback sign-in for desktop.
- Email verification and account deletion, admin-only server settings
  (ADMIN_EMAILS), fast thumbnails and document previews.
- Production deployment with Caddy (automatic HTTPS) in front of the stack.

Third-party components keep their own licenses. In particular, the Inter and
Sora fonts bundled with the apps are licensed under the SIL Open Font License
1.1, and the npm and Gradle dependencies are listed in frontend/package.json,
backend/package.json and the apps/ Gradle build files.
